          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Test it. Score a crosshatch, press tape firmly over it and pull — if paint lifts, do not coat over it. Try to work a putty knife under an edge; sound paint resists. Sprinkle water to see whether the surface is sealed or worn through in places. Failing any of these means removal.",
          },
