          <a href="#short-answer" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. The Short Answer</a>
          <a href="#test" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Testing the Existing Paint</a>
